### New HTTP contracts in this upgrade

- `GET /api/decisions/execution-evidence?correlation_id=...&account_id=...`
- `GET /api/decisions/history?correlation_id=...&after_event_id=...&limit=...`

Both require the existing `VIEW_DECISIONS` and `VIEW_EXECUTION_CONTROL`
capabilities, whose current role intersection is enabled Owner. Session and
deployment checks remain in force. These read-only GET routes do not bypass the
existing CSRF requirements on mutations. Prior phase reporting, messaging and
research-archive endpoints predate this coordinated upgrade.

## 3. Exact integration boundary

**Connected to existing application paths:** diagnostic projections/checks,
service-manager port propagation, transition recording, the two Owner APIs and
Recent Decisions UI, transport safety/attribution changes, and idle deal ingestion.

**Implemented but not connected to worker/storage/reporting:** lifecycle
assessment, current-position observation and combined position/history
reconciliation. These are supporting modules, not delivered closed-trade analytics.

**Not established:** a genuinely qualified candidate completing the actual VPS
Demo entry → fill → monitoring → exit → outcome → cockpit analytics path.

